3. REGEX RELEVANCE ENGINE
============================================================

Replace the hard-coded "interested" concept with multiple Regex
patterns.

The patterns should be easy to modify.

The initial patterns can include examples such as:

    r"\binterested\b"
    r"\blooking\s+for\b"
    r"\bneed(?:s|ed|ing)?\b"
    r"\bwants?\b"
    r"\bhiring\b"
    r"\bhire\b"
    r"\bfreelanc(?:e|er|ing)\b"
    r"\bdeveloper\b"
    r"\bdesigner\b"
    r"\bwebsite\b"

These are only starting examples.

Do NOT assume this list is final.

Make the Regex matching:

    case-insensitive
    word-aware
    easy to extend

For each matching post, record WHICH pattern matched.

Example:

    matched_pattern = r"\blooking\s+for\b"

A post can potentially match multiple patterns.

Avoid duplicate alerts for the same post caused by nested DOM elements.

